1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,742
Hello, little explorer! Let's learn the first six letters. Look, listen, and say the words with me.

2
00:00:09,208 --> 00:00:16,051
This is the letter A. Capital A, and lowercase A. A is for apple. Can you say apple?

3
00:00:19,542 --> 00:00:23,549
Apple! A is for apple. Let's say A together!

4
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:30,961
This is the letter B. Capital B, and lowercase B. B is for ball. Can you say ball?

5
00:00:34,417 --> 00:00:38,199
Ball! B is for ball. Let's say B together!

6
00:00:38,917 --> 00:00:45,995
This is the letter C. Capital C, and lowercase C. C is for cat. Can you say cat?

7
00:00:49,458 --> 00:00:53,663
Cat! C is for cat. Let's say C together!

8
00:00:54,375 --> 00:01:01,050
This is the letter D. Capital D, and lowercase D. D is for dog. Can you say dog?

9
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:08,313
Dog! D is for dog. Let's say D together!

10
00:01:09,042 --> 00:01:15,949
This is the letter E. Capital E, and lowercase E. E is for elephant. Can you say elephant?

11
00:01:19,417 --> 00:01:23,691
Elephant! E is for elephant. Let's say E together!

12
00:01:24,417 --> 00:01:31,397
This is the letter F. Capital F, and lowercase F. F is for fish. Can you say fish?

13
00:01:34,875 --> 00:01:38,866
Fish! F is for fish. Let's say F together!

14
00:01:39,583 --> 00:01:45,331
Let's say our six letters together. A. B. C. D. E. F. Now it's your turn!

15
00:01:49,792 --> 00:01:54,101
Great practicing! Now let's play a little guessing game.

16
00:01:54,833 --> 00:02:01,769
Which letter starts cat? A, C, or F? Point to it, and say the letter!

17
00:02:06,250 --> 00:02:10,506
It's C! C is for cat. Well done for trying!

18
00:02:11,208 --> 00:02:18,154
Which letter starts elephant? B, D, or E? Point to it, and say the letter!

19
00:02:22,625 --> 00:02:26,749
It's E! E is for elephant. Well done for trying!

20
00:02:27,458 --> 00:02:34,259
Which letter starts ball? F, B, or A? Point to it, and say the letter!

21
00:02:38,750 --> 00:02:42,821
It's B! B is for ball. Well done for trying!

22
00:02:43,542 --> 00:02:53,369
You practiced A, B, C, D, E, and F! Tell a grown-up your favorite word. See you next time!
